<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14400" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρεπ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unseemly, unbecoming,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι ἐπιγνῶναι, πάσχειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.57
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἄσχημον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					788b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθη . . φύλαξιν -έστατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					398e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ . . τοιαυτὶ ποιεῖν ἀπρεπές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicr.
					11.33
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρέπεια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.46
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6.11
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πῶς,</span> poet. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πέως,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				272
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				274b
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					3.13.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>disreputable, indecent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					5.40
				</span></i>
			.</div>
